{"seq":12,"trial_id":"v03-pilot-2026-10/openclaw-haiku-gbrain-told-scoped-mu-v03-dev/sy-02-marrow-agrisupply-sites/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-29T17:07:02.616Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"63373f31c2e3b6127bf53602c3758d102f4f8d55eacc464b9eb438d2c95fd0aa","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","text":"Hi Pree. I found five Marrow Agrisupply sites in #central-team and the brain. Two come straight from the channel, and three come from brain pages that summarize it, so treat those as secondhand.\n\n**From #central-team (June 9, 2026 escalation thread)**\n- **Eastbank**: a receiving-door import is in ticket PD-4821. The file labels doors E1/E2, but the booking sheet uses 01/02. Hollis is handling this.\n- **Pine Crossing**: the morning receiver's appointment screen shows only the afternoon shift. Hollis is checking the shift template.\n\n**From the brain (summaries of channel and team pages)**\n- **Enid retail distribution yard**: two seasonal gate clerks were locked out on July 8, 2026 (ticket PD-88309). Source: \"Central weekly Jul 13\" (2026-07-13).\n- **Kearney depot**: mentioned in the account page as where Marrow Agrisupply calls come from. Source: \"Marrow Agrisupply\" account page (updated 2026-09-15).\n- **Salina store**: fertilizer tankers hold overnight there, which affected the Weekly Yard Detention PDF. Source: \"Central weekly 2/10\" (2025-02-10).\n\nTwo more sites are in the 2025-04-08 MSA signing call notes: the Salina equipment yard and two retail cross-docks outside Kearney. The notes name them as Marrow Agri sites, but they could belong to Marrow Fieldworks, so please confirm before you use them on the call.\n\nI left out Kearney Machinery Annex and Salina Parts Depot. Those appear in the Marrow Fieldworks paperwork, so they are not Marrow Agrisupply sites.\n\nI couldn't confirm that the June 2026 thread covers every store, so a quick check with Hollis before the call would help."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
